# qt adds to the TODAY project, which has nothing to do with the Today view: an undated task does not join the view.
file <<END
TODAY:
Work:
	- Report @due({today})
END
keys gt
see - Report  Work
keys qt
type Undated chore
keys <Enter>
status Added to TODAY
hide Undated chore
quit
saved <<END
TODAY:
	- Undated chore
Work:
	- Report @due({today})
END
